{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"permission":"api-key-read","readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Inverse of get_quote: given a target marginal price for an outcome, returns the trade that reaches it \u2014 sized against the live automated pricing curve so you never reimplement pricing. Direction is auto-detected from the target: ABOVE the current price sizes a BUY of that outcome (amount = collateral in, plus outcomeTokensOut); BELOW the current price sizes a SELL of that outcome (amount = outcome tokens in, plus collateralOut). Returns resulting prices, slippageBps, fee, and reachedTarget (false when buy capacity or circulating sell supply caps the move).\n\nExamples: Size a buy of outcome 1 to reach price 0.60 (above current \u2192 buy); Size a sell of outcome 1 to reach price 0.40 (below current \u2192 sell)","inputSchema":{"properties":{"chainId":{"type":"number"},"marketAddress":{"type":"string"},"side":{"description":"`side` = which OUTCOME (0-indexed: 0=outcome1,1=outcome2,2=outcome3), NOT buy/sell. Buy/sell is the direction field (`type`/`tradeType`/`action`/`direction`). Encoded here as the outcome label string ('outcome1'|'outcome2'|'outcome3'), not the 0-indexed TradeSide int used on REST /trade/* bodies.","enum":["outcome1","outcome2","outcome3"],"type":"string"},"targetPrice":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["marketAddress","side","targetPrice"],"type":"object"},"name":"problee_quote_to_price","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"AmmQuoteToPriceResponseData":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"achievedPrice":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"action":{"enum":["buy","sell"],"type":"string"},"amount":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WeiString"},"collateralOut":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WeiString"},"currentPrice":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"fee":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WeiString"},"isTernary":{"type":"boolean"},"kind":{"const":"amm","default":"amm","type":"string"},"market":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EvmAddress"},"outcomeTokensOut":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WeiString"},"price1After":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"price2After":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"price3After":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"reachedTarget":{"type":"boolean"},"side":{"enum":["outcome1","outcome2","outcome3"],"type":"string"},"slippageBps":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"targetPrice":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["kind","market","side","action","targetPrice","amount","price1After","price2After","currentPrice","achievedPrice","slippageBps","fee","reachedTarget","isTernary"],"type":"object"},"EvmAddress":{"pattern":"^0x[a-fA-F0-9]{40}$","type":"string"},"McpQuoteToPriceResponse":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/AmmQuoteToPriceResponseData"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/OrderbookQuoteToPriceResponseData"}]},"OrderbookQuoteToPriceResponseData":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bestAsk":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"bestBid":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"chainId":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"kind":{"const":"orderbook","type":"string"},"market":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/EvmAddress"},{"type":"null"}]},"mid":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"side":{"enum":["outcome1","outcome2","outcome3"],"type":"string"},"spread":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^-?\\d+$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"targetPrice":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["kind","market","chainId","side","targetPrice","bestBid","bestAsk","spread","mid"],"type":"object"},"WeiString":{"pattern":"^\\d+$","type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"result":{"$ref":"#/$defs/McpQuoteToPriceResponse","anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/AmmQuoteToPriceResponseData"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/OrderbookQuoteToPriceResponseData"}]}},"required":["result"],"type":"object"},"title":"Inverse quote \u2014 size a buy or sell to reach a target outcome price"}
